{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/common_2020_mizu_020.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/common_2020_mizu_020.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_01",
      "hash64": "D7D5A314A39314EC",
      "text": "自从你帮俺拍下裙带菜之后，\\n客人都抢着吃裙带菜料理！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_02",
      "hash64": "D7D5A614A3931A05",
      "text": "那时候多谢你啦～！\\n真不愧是当冠军的料！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_03",
      "hash64": "D7D5A514A3931852",
      "text": "哎呀呀，干这样的工作\\n真是能遇到各种各样的人啊～[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_04",
      "hash64": "D7D5A014A3930FD3",
      "text": "既有像你一样\\n急流勇进的人，\\r\\n又有停滞不前的人。[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_05",
      "hash64": "D7D59F14A3930E20",
      "text": "上岁数的大人\\n往往会甘当后者，\\r\\n但俺就觉得那有点无聊。[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_06",
      "hash64": "D7D5A214A3931339",
      "text": "……川河流淌，汇于大海，\\n蒸发成云，凝结为雨。[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_07",
      "hash64": "D7D5A114A3931186",
      "text": "欲知千变万化的惊涛海岱实力如何！\\n就亲身体会一下吧！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_08",
      "hash64": "D7D5AC14A3932437",
      "text": "连首席都认可的压迫力！\\n货真价实的爆护，爆护啦！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_09",
      "hash64": "D7D5AB14A3932284",
      "text": "过猛的激流无论好坏，\\n应该都会为周围\\r\\n带来巨大的影响！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_10",
      "hash64": "D7D21E14A38FFD16",
      "text": "而且和你在一起的朋友\\n对你来说是很重要的存在啊。[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_11",
      "hash64": "D7D21F14A38FFEC9",
      "text": "年轻有力的人找上门来，\\n叔叔俺的干劲就像洪流一样！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_12",
      "hash64": "D7D21C14A38FF9B0",
      "text": "替俺告诉也慈小姐！\\n海岱会进一步蜕变……！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_13",
      "hash64": "D7D21D14A38FFB63",
      "text": "拜托你了，年轻人！\\n俺会随时欢迎你再光临的！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
